# CityLinc AI Calling Agent — Production PostgreSQL Schema Specification

**Document ID:** `PROPOSED_POSTGRESQL_SCHEMA.md`  
**Phase:** P0.2 — Final Database Design Specification (Post-Review Revision 2)  
**Status:** DRAFT / PRODUCTION-READY DDL PROPOSAL  
**Classification:** PostgreSQL Physical Database Architecture Specification  
